.\n• Bypass Tp (OP FEATURE)\n📍 [FARMING SYSTEM]\n• Multi-Area Select: Choose specific map areas to farm.\n• Rock Select & Ore Filter: Mine only the ores you want.\n• Priority System: Target specific rocks (e.g. Darkryte first).\n• Smart Switch: Auto-switches (Ore ↔ Mob) by stash space.\n• Farm Speed: Adjustable speed (20-80 studs/sec).\n• Safety Guard: Lava detection & damage zone avoidance.\n• Y-Offset Control: Fine-tune mining/combat positions.\n⚔️ [COMBAT & SAFETY]\n• Auto Kill: Clears mobs around you while mining.\n• Standalone Mob Farm: Dedicated farming with priorities.\n• Anti-AFK & Movement: Smooth tween, noclip, no camera shake.\n👁️ [VISUALS & STREAMER]\n• Full ESP: Ores, Mobs, Players, and Farm zones.\n• Name Spoofer: Hide your real name for streamer mode.\n• Security: Auto reconnect & Auto kick unwanted players.\n• Low Graphics: Optimize performance automatically.\n📊 [DISCORD WEBHOOK]\n• Live Embeds: Track stash, gold gained, and farming time.\n• Detailed Logs: Specific ore gains (e.g. +6 Darkryte).\n• Easy Setup: Test button & custom time intervals.\n💰 [AUTO SELL & STASH]\n• AutoSell: Ores, Essences, and Runes with smart filtering.\n• Rune Filtering: Sell by traits (1 trait / all / unwanted).\n• Keep Limit: Set amount to keep (e.g. keep 50, sell rest).\n• Protect Favorites: Never sell your favorited items.\n• AutoPotion: Checks stash before buying automatically.\n💾 [SYSTEM]\n• Auto Save: All settings & Webhooks saved automatically.\n• Auto Teleport: Auto join World 1 / 2 / 3.\n• Mobile Compatible: Works seamlessly on all devices.\n-------------------------------------------","tags":["THE FORGE XMAS","THE FORGE OP SCRIPT","THE FORGE BEST SCRIPT","THE FORGE UPDATE","THE FORGE AUTO FARM"],"discord":"https://discord.gg/voidw0rld","keyLink":"","owner":{"_id":"62b366e3b583da0405348471","username":"v0id64","verified":false,"profilePicture":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/704b1fd66fcece54c34e4202beefa9354fa6091e23f67f7d3472a92d466fd566.webp","original":"https://